# desc: 문헌 둘 이상을 한 근거 묶음으로 결합해 청구항을 거절한 판단은? (결손 combination-of-documents)
# suite: pa
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX pa:   <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/>
PREFIX pakr: <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/kr/>
SELECT ?j ?set (COUNT(DISTINCT ?doc) AS ?docs)
WHERE { ?j a pa:ExaminerJudgment ; pa:supportedBy ?set . ?set pa:includesDocument ?doc . }
GROUP BY ?j ?set
HAVING (COUNT(DISTINCT ?doc) >= 2)
ORDER BY ?j ?set
